{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03018","headline":"二弟宰邑南海见羣鴈南飞因成咏以寄 · 张九龄","name":"二弟宰邑南海见羣鴈南飞因成咏以寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸿雁自北来，嗷嗷度烟景。\n常怀稻粱惠，岂惮江山永。\n小大每相从，羽毛当自整。\n双凫侣晨泛，独鹤参宵警。\n爲我更南飞，因书至梅岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}